      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2025-june/q1",
      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z = \\sqrt{3} - 3i\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r(\\cos \\theta + i \\sin \\theta)\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\pi &lt; \\theta \\leq \\pi\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Show and label on a single Argand diagram</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(i) the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> representing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(ii) the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> representing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"iz\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(c) Describe the geometrical transformation that maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
