    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2025-june/q3",
      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M = \\begin{pmatrix} a &amp; b \\\\ -1 &amp; -1 \\end{pmatrix}\"></span></p><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are real constants and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a \\neq b\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Determine <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^{-1}\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M + \\mathbf M^{-1} = \\mathbf I\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf I\"></span> is the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2 \\times 2\"></span> identity matrix,</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
