      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2025-june/q10",
      "question": "<p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x + y - z = 3\"></span></p><p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ax + 3y + 5z = 4\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> is an integer.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> is perpendicular to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_3\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x + by + 13z = c\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\"></span> are integers.</p><p>Given that the three planes form a sheaf,</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) use algebra to determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p>",
